OL,3,GNEWSA'We feed and wash her': Severe ME 
OL,4,Aleaves woman bedbound for five years   
OL,6,FRowena Davies had been planning to     
OL,7,Ftravel the world with her partner until
OL,8,Fan ME diagnosis left her unable to talk
OL,9,For leave her bed.                      
OL,11,FThe 42-year-old, known as Row,         
OL,12,Finitially thought she was burnt out,   
OL,13,Fbut after years of searching for       
OL,14,Fanswers was finally diagnosed in 2021  
OL,15,Fand her partner Shauna Chambers has    
OL,16,Fsince given up work to help the family 
OL,17,Fcare for her.                          
