OL,3,GNEWSA'We feed and wash her': Severe ME 
OL,4,Aleaves woman bedbound for five years   
OL,6,FCampaigners are warning that people    
OL,7,Fwith severe ME - sometimes referred to 
OL,8,Fclinically as myalgic                  
OL,9,Fencephalomyelitis/chronic fatigue      
OL,10,Fsyndrome - could die without changes to
OL,11,Fservices in Wales.                     
OL,13,FThe Welsh government said proposals for
OL,14,Fan allb@QWales specialist, an expert   
OL,15,Fgroup and national standards were being
OL,16,Fconsidered.                            
